# FilterBlade: Conditional Entry
Show
SetFontSize 45
BaseType == "The Forgotten Treasure" "Costly Curio" "The Innocent" "Emperor's Luck" "Home" "Gemcutter's Mercy"
PlayAlertSound 2 300
MinimapIcon 2 White Triangle
PlayEffect White
SetTextColor 255 255 255 193

# FilterBlade: Conditional Entry
Show
SetFontSize 45
Rarity Unique
BaseType == "Unset Ring"
PlayAlertSound 2 300
MinimapIcon 1 Blue Star
PlayEffect Blue
Corrupted True
Identified True

